# ==============================================================================
# Citadel – Environment Configuration Guide
# ==============================================================================
# Citadel is divided into two independent sub-projects:
#
# 1. Backend:  citadel/backend/.env
#    Copy backend/.env.example to backend/.env and populate:
#      - PORT=5000
#      - NODE_ENV=development
#      - MONGODB_URI=mongodb+srv://...
#      - JWT_SECRET=your_jwt_secret
#      - ENCRYPTION_SECRET=64_character_hex_key_for_aes_256_gcm
#      - FRONTEND_URL=http://localhost:5173
#      - STORAGE_PROVIDER=local
#
# 2. Frontend: citadel/frontend/.env
#    Copy frontend/.env.example to frontend/.env and populate:
#      - VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000
#
# NEVER COMMIT REAL SECRETS OR .env FILES TO GIT.
# ==============================================================================
